sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant CLI as CodeFire CLI
  participant IDX as Indexer
  participant FIRE as Fire Engine
  participant POL as Policy Engine
  participant VER as Verifier
  participant STORE as Object Store

  U->>CLI: codefire commit -m ...
  CLI->>IDX: scan open directory
  IDX-->>CLI: current atom index
  CLI->>FIRE: update fires
  FIRE-->>CLI: active fires
  CLI->>POL: committable check
  POL-->>CLI: pass/fail
  CLI->>VER: run verification
  VER-->>CLI: verification result
  CLI->>STORE: write blobs/manifests/commit
  STORE-->>CLI: commit id
  CLI-->>U: sealed commit created

